# api-question-bank

`QUESTION_BANK_MANAGE` is granted only to Master Admin. A System Admin receives `403` on every bank route.

A bank is a named list of question ids. It may mix MCQ and written questions. The name is one language. It does not generate a paper or an attempt.

Adding a question to a bank, or removing it from a bank, does not change `component_questions`. A bank has no attempt route and no price.

```text
POST /api/v1/question-banks
```

That route selects existing questions. It does not move them off their papers.
